-- AWS for Database Administrators — downloadable lab code
-- Lab 5 — Oracle GoldenGate to AWS
-- Step 3 — Configure and start Extract
-- Block: Write the Extract parameter file (EDIT PARAMS ESHOP)
-- EDIT PARAMS ESHOP:
-- Enter with: EDIT PARAMS ESHOP
--
-- GoldenGate parameter file. In the Admin Client run EDIT PARAMS (name),
-- replace the editor contents with the lines below, save and exit.
-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------

EXTRACT ESHOP
USERIDALIAS src_pdb DOMAIN OracleGoldenGate
EXTTRAIL es
TABLE shop.*;
